## 7. Governance Review Workflow

Based on materiality outcome, state the required governance path clearly:

```
Non-Material:
  └─ Initiate NMAA Review
       └─ Approved → No further architectural review required

Material:
  └─ Initiate ARF Review
       └─ Approved → Initiate SIA / Data / Resilience Review
            └─ Approved → Initiate FTC Review
                 └─ If Cloud Platform involved → Also initiate CCH Review
```

Always output the applicable governance path as part of the SI document summary.

