## 9. Document Versioning & Change Log

Every generated SI document must include a version history table at the top of each chapter:

| Version | Date       | Author   | Change Summary          |
| ------- | ---------- | -------- | ----------------------- |
| 1.0     | YYYY-MM-DD | [Author] | Initial draft           |
| 1.1     | YYYY-MM-DD | [Author] | [Description of change] |

- Version format: `MAJOR.MINOR` (e.g., 1.0 for new, 1.1 for minor update, 2.0 for major revision)
- Always increment version when a chapter is updated.
- Preserve previous version history — do not delete old rows.

